  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 4 × 18 = 40 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and -\n\n112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 4 × 18 = 40 ⇒ **112 ÷ 14**__ - 40 + 4 × 18 = 40\n\n8 - 40 + __**4 × 18**__ = 40 \n\n__**8 + 72**__ - 40 = 40\n\n__**80 - 40**__ = 40\n\n \n\n40 = 40 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : + and ÷​\n\n112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 4 × 18 = 40 ⇒ 112 - 14 + **40 ÷ 4**__ × 18 = 40\n\n112 - 14 + __**10 × 18**__ = 40\n\n__**112 + 180**__ - 14 = 40\n\n__**292 - 14**__ = 40\n\n278 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and × \n\n112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 4 × 18 = 40 ⇒ 112 - **14 ÷ 40**__ × 4 + 18 = 40\n\n112 - __**0.35 ×**____** 4**__ + 18 = 40\n\n__**112 + 18**__ - 1.4 = 40\n\n__**130 - 1.4**__ = 40\n\n128.6 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : - and +\n\n112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 4 × 18 = 40 ⇒ 112 + **14 ÷ 40**__ - 4 × 18 = 40\n\n112 + 0.35 - __**4 × 18**__ = 40\n\n__**112 + 0.35**__ - 72 = 40\n\n__**112.35 - 72**__ = 40\n\n40.35 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
